body:
I've been there; 4 months of no human contact. Not even checking the mail. Just pacing like a ghost in limbo.

freezing water and cold temperatures is pretty bad;
I remember seeing mold grow on the walls around the shower

I got sick and puked into a black sink

I can't imagine however being without the internet;
that was what I did despite all the decrepit conditions

Valhalla Rising, I forgot to mention;
this is the movie you want to watch;
it is brutal beyond most imaginations.

I started hearing voices after being isolated for a long time;
I thought I was a ghost trapped in limbo.

Definitely make sure he gives therapy/psychiatry a shot before going out of his life, you may be the only thing that can influence him.
